{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">特區政府早上舉行儀式，紀念中國人民抗日戰爭勝利。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">全體先奏唱國歌，行政長官李家超、全國政協副主席梁振英、中聯辦主任周霽，以及政府高層官員出席。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CEREMONY-0830_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ttkFKgFGcS1788395709.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CEREMONY-0830_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">升旗儀式後，警察步槍儀仗隊鳴槍致敬。全體出席者低頭默哀兩分鐘，並向紀念龕鞠躬致意。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CEREMONY-0830.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026QlKnzkGGOC1788395712.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CEREMONY-0830.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">出席儀式的還包括解放軍駐港部隊代表、紀律部隊成員、中學生、制服團體代表，退伍軍人團體及東江縱隊等抗日戰士亦有出席儀式。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T02:23:56.414475+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}